WHAT'S IMPORTANT ABOUT THIS

00:19:33.169 --> 00:19:35.389
PROGRAM ISN'T ONLY THAT WE

00:19:35.389 --> 00:19:37.090
UNDERSTOOD ASPECTS THAT

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:38.660
CONTRIBUTED TO THE UNDERSTANDING

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:39.840
OF VIOLENCE, BUT HOW HEALTH

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:41.660
PROFESSIONALS DEVELOPED POLICIES

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:43.710
AND PROCEDURES THAT ENABLED THEM

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:45.730
TO MANAGE, TO UNDERSTAND, TO

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:47.860
DETECT VIOLENCE IN A PERSON.

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:49.220
THEY NEEDED TO BRING TOGETHER

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:50.360
WHAT WE WOULD CALL THE GRAY

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:51.590
LITERATURE, MEETING NOTES FROM

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:53.380
HOSPITAL MEETINGS, SMALL

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:54.880
GUIDELINES FROM THE INSTITUTIONS

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:56.549
AS THEY BEGAN TO UNDERSTAND AND

00:19:56.549 --> 00:19:58.429
CONFRONT THIS PROBLEM WHICH WE

00:19:58.429 --> 00:20:00.720
NOW KNOW BROADLY AS VIOLENCE,

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:02.390
INTIMATE PARTNER VIOLENCE.

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:03.779
WITHOUT ASPECTS, WITHOUT

00:20:03.779 --> 00:20:06.080
EXPLORATIONS LIKE THAT, WE WOULD

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:07.460
NOT FIRST OF ALL BE ABLE TO CALL

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:09.370
THE PUBLIC'S ATTENTION IN A

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:10.370
MEANINGFUL WAY TO HOW KNOWLEDGE

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:11.779
BUILDS, BUT MORE IMPORTANTLY, WE

00:20:11.779 --> 00:20:13.299
WOULD NOT BE ABLE TO DOCUMENT

00:20:13.299 --> 00:20:14.500
HOW KNOWLEDGE BUILDS.

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:16.970
THIS IS CRITICAL FOR US.

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:19.500
THE NATIONAL LIBRARY OF MEDICINE

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:21.179
ACCELERATES AND PLAYS A CRITICAL

00:20:21.179 --> 00:20:22.519
ROLE IN SHAPING THE FEDERAL

00:20:22.519 --> 00:20:24.950
POLICIES ON OPEN SCIENCE.

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:27.129
FLEUWE DEVELOPED THE FIRST OPEN

00:20:27.129 --> 00:20:29.830
ACCESS STRATEGY ADOPTED BY MANY

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:32.070
FEDERAL AGENCIES IN WHICH THE

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:34.669
RESEARCH FINDINGS BUILT ON

00:20:34.669 --> 00:20:36.470
FEDERAL FUNDS, YOUR TAX DOLLARS

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:38.059
ARE MADE AVAILABLE QUICKLY AND

00:20:38.059 --> 00:20:40.360
BROADLY AND WITHOUT RESTRICTION

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:42.460
TO THE GENERAL PUBLIC.

00:20:42.460 --> 00:20:45.409
WE HAVE ALSO WORKED TO MAKE SURE

00:20:45.409 --> 00:20:48.879
THAT THER THE VAST RESOURCES ARE

00:20:48.879 --> 00:20:51.889
STRAIBL THROUGH OPEN APPLICATION

00:20:51.889 --> 00:20:53.190
PROGRAMMING INTERFACES SO THAT

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:54.450
OTHERS WHO WANT TO BUILD TOOLS

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:56.630
UPON OUR WORK ARE ABLE TO DO

00:20:56.630 --> 00:20:57.630
THAT.

00:20:57.630 --> 00:21:00.320
SO WE SUPPORT NOT ONLY ACCESS TO

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:02.509
THE KNOWLEDGE BUT TOOLS TO HELP

00:21:02.509 --> 00:21:03.860
USE THE KNOWLEDGE.

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:05.820
THIS IS A GREAT THING.

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.399
RECENTLY WE'VE BEGUN TO TAKE UP

00:21:07.399 --> 00:21:09.460
THE FEDERAL CHALLENGE -- EXCUSE

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:11.230
ME -- THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:13.490
CREATE CHARGE TO CREATE

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:14.960
CHALLENGES.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:16.379
THE NATIONAL LIBRARY OF MEDICINE

00:21:16.379 --> 00:21:18.919
IMAGE RECOGNITION CHALLENGE WAS

00:21:18.919 --> 00:21:21.600
A WAY TO ENGAGE CITIZENS IN

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:23.100
SCIENCE, PUBLIC DATA AVAILABLE

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:25.169
FOR SCIENTISTS AND LAY PEOPLE TO

00:21:25.169 --> 00:21:26.779
IMPROVE PATIENT SAFETY.

00:21:26.779 --> 00:21:28.330
THE BASIC QUESTION THAT WAS

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:29.330
ASKED WAS, CAN YOUR CELL PHONE

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:30.820
TELL WHAT PILL THAT IS?

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:32.429
THIS COULD BE USEFUL.

00:21:32.429 --> 00:21:33.759
CAN A CELL PHONE TELL WHAT PILL

00:21:33.759 --> 00:21:35.500
IT IS CAN HELP AN INDIVIDUAL

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:36.680
FAMILY MEMBER IN THE MIDDLE OF

00:21:36.680 --> 00:21:37.680
THE NIGHT TRYING TO UNDERSTAND,

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:38.690
WHAT WAS THAT PILL THAT MY KID

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:39.730
SWALLOWED?

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:40.930
WHAT'S GOING ON WITH ME?

00:21:40.930 --> 00:21:42.470
WHAT DO I NEED TO DO?

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:43.720
OUR FIRST PRIZE WINNER CAME FROM

00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:45.009
A TEAM OF STUDENTS AT MICHIGAN

00:21:45.009 --> 00:21:46.460
STATE UNIVERSITY.

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:47.950
THEY WERE ABLE, GIVEN A TRAINING

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:51.200
SET OF 7,000 IMAGES AND 1,000

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:52.840
TESTING IMAGES, TO IDENTIFY 75%

00:21:52.840 --> 00:21:55.019
OF THE PILLS ACCURATELY.

00:21:55.019 --> 00:21:56.530
WHAT WE'RE LEARNING IS HOW TO

00:21:56.530 --> 00:21:58.501
TAKE EMERGING TECHNOLOGIES, CELL

00:21:58.501 --> 00:22:00.419
PHONE, SIMPLE SMARTPHONE

00:22:00.419 --> 00:22:02.049
TECHNOLOGIES, AND USE THAT TO

00:22:02.049 --> 00:22:03.240
HELP PEOPLE BETTER THEIR OWN

00:22:03.240 --> 00:22:04.790
HEALTH AT A POINT WHERE THEY

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:06.490
NEED TO BE, AND WHERE WE NEED TO

00:22:06.490 --> 00:22:09.559
SUPPORT THEM.

00:22:09.559 --> 00:22:11.850
WE ARE ALSO TRYING TO IMPROVE

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:12.850
HEALTHCARE.

00:22:12.850 --> 00:22:14.230
WE ULTIMATELY DO NOT GIVE CARE

00:22:14.230 --> 00:22:16.159
BUT OUR STANDARDS OF

00:22:16.159 --> 00:22:17.380
TERMINOLOGIES, OUR HUMAN FACTORS

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:20.149
UNDERSTANDING ARE TO DELIVER

00:22:20.149 --> 00:22:21.670
INFORMATION IN A MOMENT ALL

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.590
ALLOW US TO ENSURE THAT THE

00:22:24.590 --> 00:22:26.009
INFORMATION NEEDED BY HEALTH

00:22:26.009 --> 00:22:27.379
PROFESSIONALS AT THE POANT OF
POINT OF

00:22:27.379 --> 00:22:29.130
CARE IS AVAILABLE THERE AND

00:22:29.130 --> 00:22:31.789
SECONDARILY THAT IT FLOWS INTO A

00:22:31.789 --> 00:22:33.240
LARGER AND MORE COMPLETE

00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:35.730
UNDERSTANDING OF ALL OF THE KIND

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:38.059
OF PRACTICE-BASED INTERVENTIONS

00:22:38.059 --> 00:22:39.740
THAT LEAD TO AN IMPROVEMENT IN

00:22:39.740 --> 00:22:41.980
THE HEALTH OF OUR POPULATIONS.

00:22:41.980 --> 00:22:43.179
WATCH WITH ME FOR A MOMENT WHILE

00:22:43.179 --> 00:22:44.950
WE CELEBRATE OUR PRESENT IN THE

00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:46.440
WORK GOING ON HERE AT THE

00:22:46.440 --> 00:23:46.490
NATIONAL LIBRARY OF MEDICINE.

00:23:46.490 --> 00:24:17.970
&gt;&gt; THIS IS A GREAT PLACE TO

00:24:17.970 --> 00:24:19.110
WORK.

00:24:19.110 --> 00:24:20.850
THE ACCOMPLISHMENTS OF THE

00:24:20.850 --> 00:24:22.470
COLLEAGUES AND THE DIRECTORS AND

00:24:22.470 --> 00:24:23.720
THE MANAGERS AND THE STAFF THAT

00:24:23.720 --> 00:24:24.990
HAVE GONE BEFORE ME PROVIDE A

00:24:24.990 --> 00:24:28.299
BASIS FOR US TO KNOW THAT WE CAN

00:24:28.299 --> 00:24:30.179
DEVELOP THE RESOURCES NEEDED TO

00:24:30.179 --> 00:24:31.649
HELP MEET THE CHALLENGES OF THE

00:24:31.649 --> 00:24:32.759
WORLD.

00:24:32.759 --> 00:24:34.120
I WANT YOU TO ANTICIPATE WITH ME

00:24:34.120 --> 00:24:35.740
FOR A FEW MINUTES, WHAT THE

00:24:35.740 --> 00:24:38.460
FUTURE MAY HOLD FOR THE HEALTH

00:24:38.460 --> 00:24:39.789
OF THE POPULATION, FOR THE

00:24:39.789 --> 00:24:41.029
HEALTH OF YOUR FAMILY, FOR

00:24:41.029 --> 00:24:42.210
YOURSELF.

00:24:42.210 --> 00:24:43.299
IT'S IMPORTANT FOR US AT THE

00:24:43.299 --> 00:24:44.669
NATIONAL LIBRARY OF MEDICINE TO

00:24:44.669 --> 00:24:46.299
THINK ABOUT WHAT CHALLENGES LIE

00:24:46.299 --> 00:24:47.780
AHEAD IN HEALTHCARE, BECAUSE WE

00:24:47.780 --> 00:24:49.169
NEED TO BE READY WITH THE

00:24:49.169 --> 00:24:50.360
INFORMATION RESOURCES AND

00:24:50.360 --> 00:24:52.110
SUPPORTS NEEDED TO EITHER HELP

00:24:52.110 --> 00:24:54.090
DISCOVERING CHARACTERIZE THEM OR

00:24:54.090 --> 00:24:55.740
TO SUFFICIENTLY BRING

00:24:55.740 --> 00:24:57.419
INFORMATION TO BE ABLE TO ASSIST

00:24:57.419 --> 00:24:58.419
WITH THEM.

00:24:58.419 --> 00:25:00.040
NOW YOU ALL EACH HAVE YOUR OWN

00:25:00.040 --> 00:25:01.670
THREE OR FOUR TOP HEALTHCARE

00:25:01.670 --> 00:25:03.130
CONCERNS OF THE MOMENT, AND IF

00:25:03.130 --> 00:25:04.370
YOU DON'T, I ASK YOU TO TAKE A

00:25:04.370 --> 00:25:05.580
MOMENT RIGHT NOW TO THINK OF

00:25:05.580 --> 00:25:07.130
THEM, BECAUSE THEY ARE WHAT

00:25:07.130 --> 00:25:08.980
DRIVES US TO MAKE THE

00:25:08.980 --> 00:25:12.950
INFORMATION TOOLS RESPONSIVE.

00:25:12.950 --> 00:25:15.029
I'D LIKE TO CALL THREE TO YOUR

00:25:15.029 --> 00:25:16.029
ATTENTION.

00:25:16.029 --> 00:25:17.090
FIRST, THE GENETIC DISCOVERIES

00:25:17.090 --> 00:25:18.210
OF THE LAST 20 YEARS HAVE

00:25:18.210 --> 00:25:19.899
HERALDED A PROMISE OF PRECISION

00:25:19.899 --> 00:25:22.179
MEDICINE THAT NOW MAY BE

00:25:22.179 --> 00:25:24.009
REALIZED, SO WE MAY KNOW NOT TO

00:25:24.009 --> 00:25:25.159
GIVE YOU CODEINE BECAUSE YOU

00:25:25.159 --> 00:25:26.679
LACK THE GENE THAT MAKES THE

00:25:26.679 --> 00:25:28.169
ENZYMES PHARMACOLOGICALLY

00:25:28.169 --> 00:25:31.820
ACCESSIBLE TO YOU, OR IT MAY BE

00:25:31.820 --> 00:25:33.379
BET INVENTORY TREAT YOU WITH A

00:25:33.379 --> 00:25:34.879
CERTAIN APPROACH TO YOUR CANCER

00:25:34.879 --> 00:25:36.250
THAN WHAT WAS ORIGINALLY THOUGHT

00:25:36.250 --> 00:25:37.910
BASED ON YOUR SYMPTOMATOLOGY.

00:25:37.910 --> 00:25:39.899
BUT IT ALSO REQUIRES THAT WE

00:25:39.899 --> 00:25:42.169
HELP EVERY PERSON UNDERSTAND

00:25:42.169 --> 00:25:43.860
THIS COMPLEX TWISTY GENOME

00:25:43.860 --> 00:25:46.470
INSIDE THEM, AND WAYS TO DO THAT

00:25:46.470 --> 00:25:48.279
THAT REACH ACROSS THE LITERACY

00:25:48.279 --> 00:25:49.730
LINES, THAT REACH INTO THE

00:25:49.730 --> 00:25:51.070
EVERYDAY SCHOOLS OF CHILDREN,

00:25:51.070 --> 00:25:53.629
THAT REACH TO MY MOM, ARE A PART

00:25:53.629 --> 00:25:54.900
OF OUR PURVIEW.

00:25:54.900 --> 00:25:56.621
SECOND, INFECTIOUS DISEASE

00:25:56.621 --> 00:25:58.950
REMAINS HUGELY PROBLEMATIC, AND

00:25:58.950 --> 00:26:00.160
WHAT WE'RE LEARNING MORE BECAUSE

00:26:00.160 --> 00:26:01.320
OF OUR WORK HERE AT THE NATIONAL

00:26:01.320 --> 00:26:02.690
LIBRARY OF MEDICINE IS THAT

00:26:02.690 --> 00:26:04.309
MUTATIONS OCCUR QUICKLY AND

00:26:04.309 --> 00:26:06.850
DIFFERENTIALLY ACROSS THE WORLD.

00:26:06.850 --> 00:26:07.850
UNDERSTANDING HOW THOSE

00:26:07.850 --> 00:26:09.090
MUTATIONS ARE OCCURRING, WHEN TO

00:26:09.090 --> 00:26:11.470
ANTICIPATE THEY MIGHT BE EMERGE,

00:26:11.470 --> 00:26:12.899
WILL ALLOW CLINICIANS TO BETTER

00:26:12.899 --> 00:26:14.389
RESPOND TO THEM.

00:26:14.389 --> 00:26:16.269
FINALLY, WE MUST MENTION CHRONIC

00:26:16.269 --> 00:26:18.820
DISEASES, ASTHMA, DIABETES,

00:26:18.820 --> 00:26:19.820
HYPERTENSION.

00:26:19.820 --> 00:26:21.559
THEY CONTINUE UNABATED AND

00:26:21.559 --> 00:26:22.559
THEY'RE IN SOME WAYS GROWING,

00:26:22.559 --> 00:26:24.940
AND WHILE I HAVE BEEN A PART OF

00:26:24.940 --> 00:26:26.759
THE COMMUNITY THAT HAS SAID LET

00:26:26.759 --> 00:26:29.590
THE PATIENTS PARTICIPATE, FOR

00:26:29.590 --> 00:26:31.320
THEY WILL HELP US, I ALSO

00:26:31.320 --> 00:26:33.289
RECOGNIZE THAT GOOD INTENTIONS

00:26:33.289 --> 00:26:34.639
IS NOT ENOUGH.

00:26:34.639 --> 00:26:36.249
POWERFUL INFORMATION, EFFECTIVE

00:26:36.249 --> 00:26:37.390
INFORMATION TOOLS, GOOD

00:26:37.390 --> 00:26:39.850
SURVEILLANCE ARE ALSO NECESSARY.

00:26:39.850 --> 00:26:41.820
SO INFECTIOUS DISEASES -- EXCUSE

00:26:41.820 --> 00:26:43.269
ME, SO CHRONIC DISEASE

00:26:43.269 --> 00:26:45.230
MANAGEMENT, WHICH WILL REMAIN A

00:26:45.230 --> 00:26:46.230
PARTNERSHIP BETWEEN

00:26:46.230 --> 00:26:47.890
PROFESSIONALS AND PATIENTS, HAS

00:26:47.890 --> 00:26:49.929
A THIRD LEG OF THAT STOOL THAT I

00:26:49.929 --> 00:26:51.169
THINK OF A AS THE NATIONAL
LIBRARY

00:26:51.169 --> 00:26:52.790
OF MEDICINE.

00:26:52.790 --> 00:26:54.740
AS WE THINK TOWARDS HOW WE WILL

00:26:54.740 --> 00:26:58.090
HELP, WHAT WILL WE DO?

00:26:58.090 --> 00:26:59.241
THE NATIONAL LIBRARY OF MEDICINE

00:26:59.241 --> 00:27:00.840
HAS CERTAIN THINGS WE CAN DO AND

00:27:00.840 --> 00:27:02.769
CERTAIN THINGS WE CAN'T DO.

00:27:02.769 --> 00:27:04.029
I'M GOING TO BRING FORWARD THREE

00:27:04.029 --> 00:27:05.659
CHALLENGES THAT I HOPE WE'LL BE

00:27:05.659 --> 00:27:07.149
ABLE TO DO.

00:27:07.149 --> 00:27:09.399
WE DON'T DO SURGERY UPSTAIRS.

00:27:09.399 --> 00:27:11.640
AND WE HAVE NO BLOOD BANKS HERE.

00:27:11.640 --> 00:27:13.570
BUT WE CAN BEGIN TO TAKE A

00:27:13.570 --> 00:27:15.159
LIFESPAN AND A LIFE FLOW

00:27:15.159 --> 00:27:17.480
APPROACH TO UNDERSTANDING

00:27:17.480 --> 00:27:19.909
COMPLEX CHRONIC DISEASES, TO

00:27:19.909 --> 00:27:20.909
UNDERSTAND THE CONSEQUENCES IN

00:27:20.909 --> 00:27:23.190
ADULT HEALTH AND CHILD EXPOSURES

00:27:23.190 --> 00:27:24.919
AND THINK OF HEALTH AS NOT A

00:27:24.919 --> 00:27:27.419
MOMENT IN TIME BUT AS A PROCESS

00:27:27.419 --> 00:27:29.240
ACROSS TIME.

00:27:29.240 --> 00:27:30.740
THAT REQUIRES US TO RE-THINK HOW

00:27:30.740 --> 00:27:32.470
WE INDEX, THAT REQUIRES US TO

00:27:32.470 --> 00:27:34.220
UNDERSTAND SEQUENTIAL AND

00:27:34.220 --> 00:27:35.360
VERSIONING ACTIVITIES THAT

00:27:35.360 --> 00:27:36.799
REQUIRES US TO UNDERSTAND

00:27:36.799 --> 00:27:39.110
INFORMATION AS AN INTERACTION,

00:27:39.110 --> 00:27:41.039
NOT AS A DELIVERY MECHANISM.

00:27:41.039 --> 00:27:43.150
SECOND, WE NEED -- WE CAN

00:27:43.150 --> 00:27:44.429
SUPPORT THE CREATION OF A

00:27:44.429 --> 00:27:45.999
LEARNING HEALTH SYSTEM THAT

00:27:45.999 --> 00:27:48.170
BETTER LEVERAGE DATA, TO BETTER

00:27:48.170 --> 00:27:50.789
FOSTER EFFECTIVE HEALTHCARE.

00:27:50.789 --> 00:27:52.649
WE CAN DO THIS BY IMPROVING THE

00:27:52.649 --> 00:27:53.860
DISSEMINATION AND USE OF

00:27:53.860 --> 00:27:55.389
STANDARD WAYS OF EXPRESSING

00:27:55.389 --> 00:27:57.029
HEALTHCARE PROBLEMS, OF ASSURING

00:27:57.029 --> 00:27:58.369
THAT YOUR HEADACHE IN NEW YORK

00:27:58.369 --> 00:27:59.980
IS DESCRIBED IN THE SAME WAY AS

00:27:59.980 --> 00:28:01.600
YOUR HEADACHE IN CALIFORNIA.

00:28:01.600 --> 00:28:02.630
BUT MORE IMPORTANTLY IS THE

00:28:02.630 --> 00:28:03.950
COMPUTATIONAL MODELS THAT

00:28:03.950 --> 00:28:06.019
UNDERLIE THAT, ARE AVAILABLE AND

00:28:06.019 --> 00:28:08.110
ACCESSIBLE AND CAN BE APPLIED TO

00:28:08.110 --> 00:28:09.110
INFORMATION.

00:28:09.110 --> 00:28:10.389
AND FINALLY, I BELIEVE MOST THAT

00:28:10.389 --> 00:28:12.090
WE CAN CONTINUE AT THE LIBRARY

00:28:12.090 --> 00:28:14.299
TO DO WHAT WE'VE STARTED OVER

00:28:14.299 --> 00:28:15.840
THE YEARS, WHICH IS ENABLING

00:28:15.840 --> 00:28:17.340
IMPROVED TREATMENT AND BETTER

00:28:17.340 --> 00:28:18.789
SELF-MANAGEMENT BY HARNESSING

00:28:18.789 --> 00:28:20.559
TECHNOLOGIES.

00:28:20.559 --> 00:28:22.360
WE ARE NOT THE NATIONAL HEART

00:28:22.360 --> 00:28:23.400
LUNG AND BLOOD INSTITUTE, WE'RE

00:28:23.400 --> 00:28:24.730
NOT GOING TO UNDERSTAND AND

00:28:24.730 --> 00:28:26.649
DISCOVER THE BASIC PHYSIOLOGY

00:28:26.649 --> 00:28:28.220
BUT WE WILL BE ABLE TO PROVIDE

00:28:28.220 --> 00:28:30.350
TOOLS FOR UNDERSTANDING, FOR

00:28:30.350 --> 00:28:31.720
ACCELERATING THAT UNDERSTANDING

00:28:31.720 --> 00:28:33.419
AND FOR PEOPLE TO TAKE ACTION ON

00:28:33.419 --> 00:28:34.419
THEM.

00:28:34.419 --> 00:28:35.440
SO NOW WALK WITH ME AS WE

00:28:35.440 --> 00:28:38.059
ANTICIPATE OUR FUTURE A LITTLE

00:28:38.059 --> 00:28:39.059
BIT.

00:28:39.059 --> 00:28:40.059
WHAT SHOULD THE NATIONAL LIBRARY

00:28:40.059 --> 00:28:41.059
OF MEDICINE DO?

00:28:41.059 --> 00:28:42.059
WELL, ONE OF THE THINGS I'VE

00:28:42.059 --> 00:28:43.059
LEARNED IN THE FIRST THREE WEEKS

00:28:43.059 --> 00:28:44.059
THAT I'VE BEEN HERE IS THAT THE

00:28:44.059 --> 00:28:45.059
DIRECTOR DOESN'T HAVE A WHOLE

00:28:45.059 --> 00:28:46.820
LOT OF SAY OVER THIS, BUT THE

00:28:46.820 --> 00:28:50.249
DIRECTOR CAN SHINE A SPOTLIGHT

00:28:50.249 --> 00:28:52.049
AND PROVIDE A LITTLE DIRECTION

00:28:52.049 --> 00:28:53.320
AND SOMETIMES NUDGE WITH A

00:28:53.320 --> 00:28:54.799
LITTLE MONEY, AND THAT'S WHERE I

00:28:54.799 --> 00:28:56.029
WILL BE SPENDING MY NEXT FEW

00:28:56.029 --> 00:28:57.159
YEARS.

00:28:57.159 --> 00:28:58.519
BUT REMEMBER FIRST AND FOREMOST,

00:28:58.519 --> 00:28:59.659
THE NATIONAL LIBRARY OF MEDICINE

00:28:59.659 --> 00:29:01.880
IS ABOUT DISCOVERY, AND

00:29:01.880 --> 00:29:03.470
DISCOVERY IN TWO PLANES, ONE IS

00:29:03.470 --> 00:29:05.299
SUPPORTING THE BIOMEDICAL

00:29:05.299 --> 00:29:06.899
SCIENCES DISCOVERIES, AND

00:29:06.899 --> 00:29:08.530
SECONDARILY, TO UNDERSTANDING

00:29:08.530 --> 00:29:10.129
BASIC BIOMEDICAL INFORMATICS

00:29:10.129 --> 00:29:11.179
DISCOVERIES.

00:29:11.179 --> 00:29:12.629
WE NEED BETTER LANGUAGE

